@startuml
title 模型路由优化的是每次验证成功的成本

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "路由 Attempt\nmodel / tokens / latency / price" as attempt #E0F2FE
rectangle "失败路径\nretry / fallback / invalid output / wasted tools" as failure #FEE2E2
rectangle "验证链\nschema / tool / engine / evidence / user outcome" as verify #FEF3C7
rectangle "成功样本\nverified_success=true" as success #DCFCE7
rectangle "全路径成本\nmodel + tools + infra + failure + human" as total
rectangle "分桶指标\nCost per Verified Success\n任务 × 风险 × 模型版本" as metric #DCFCE7

attempt --> verify
attempt --> failure
failure --> attempt : 新 attempt
verify --> success
attempt --> total
failure --> total
success --> metric
total --> metric

note right of metric
  单次 token 便宜但反复失败，
  可能是更贵的路由选择
end note
@enduml
